---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /gallery.html
seoTitle: The Gallery | I am the Seouler
description: "Wherever I am, one frame at a time. 저널에 실린 모든 사진, 그리고 그 사진이 나온 글로 돌아가는 길."
ogImage: /og/og-gallery.jpg
---
{% set photos = collections.galleryPhotos %}
<div class="wrap">
  {% include "nav.njk" %}
</div>

<header class="story-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="story-meta">The Gallery</div>
    {# Not "Seoul, one frame at a time" any more: the gallery holds Macau,
       Hong Kong and a village in Gwangyang as well. "Wherever I am" keeps the
       rhythm and picks up the tagline — living where you are is the same act
       whether that place is home or somewhere you are passing through. #}
    <h1>Wherever I am, one frame at a time.</h1>
    <p class="story-sub-kr">있는 곳에서, 한 장면씩.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="gallery-page">
  {%- if photos.length %}
  <div class="wrap">
    {%- if collections.galleryLabels.length > 1 %}
    <div class="chips" role="group" aria-label="글별로 보기">
      <button type="button" class="chip is-on" data-filter="*">All</button>
      {%- for label in collections.galleryLabels %}
      <button type="button" class="chip" data-filter="{{ label }}">{{ label }}</button>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    {%- endif %}

    <div class="photo-wall" data-lb-group>
      {%- for p in photos %}
      <figure class="plate" data-lb data-label="{{ p.label }}"
              tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="{{ p.alt }} — 크게 보기"
              data-full="{{ p.image }}"
              data-alt="{{ p.alt }}"
              data-cap-en="{{ p.caption_en }}"
              data-cap-ko="{{ p.caption_ko }}"
              data-post-url="{{ p.postUrl }}"
              data-post-title="{{ p.postTitle }}"
              data-post-label="{{ p.label }}">
        <img src="{{ p.image }}" alt="{{ p.alt }}" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 88vw, (max-width: 780px) 44vw, 320px" loading="lazy">
      </figure>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="wall-empty" hidden>이 글에는 아직 사진이 없습니다.</p>
  </div>
  {%- else %}
  <div class="wrap"><p class="gallery-empty">아직 올린 사진이 없습니다.</p></div>
  {%- endif %}
</main>

<div class="story-close">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="back" href="/#journal">← Back to the Journal</a>
  </div>
</div>

{% include "lightbox.njk" %}

<script>
  (function () {
    var chips = [].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.chip'));
    if (!chips.length) return;
    var plates = [].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.plate'));
    var empty = document.querySelector('.wall-empty');

    chips.forEach(function (chip) {
      chip.addEventListener('click', function () {
        var want = chip.dataset.filter;
        chips.forEach(function (c) { c.classList.toggle('is-on', c === chip); });
        var kept = 0;
        plates.forEach(function (plate) {
          var keep = want === '*' || plate.dataset.label === want;
          plate.hidden = !keep;
          if (keep) kept++;
        });
        if (empty) empty.hidden = kept > 0;
      });
    });
  })();
</script>
